cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "crowdGP"
abstract: >-
  Gaussian-process models for learning from crowds: fitting a classifier from
  noisy, incomplete crowdsourced annotations jointly with a model of each
  annotator's reliability. The default configuration reproduces SVGPCR.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/wizmik12/crowdGP"
url: "https://github.com/wizmik12/crowdGP"
keywords:
  - crowdsourcing
  - learning from crowds
  - Gaussian processes
  - variational inference
  - weak supervision
authors:
